addTest('basic-modals',[
 ['She ___ swim very well; she learned as a child.|My brother ___ speak three languages.|The technician ___ repair this device.|Our teacher ___ explain this topic clearly.','can|cans|can to|is can','Can không thêm -s và theo sau bằng nguyên mẫu không to.'],
 ['You ___ wear a helmet here; it is required by the rules.|Visitors ___ show ID at this secure entrance.|All drivers ___ stop at a red light.|Staff ___ keep client passwords secret; it is compulsory.','must|must to|musts|are must','Must diễn tả nghĩa vụ mạnh hoặc yêu cầu bắt buộc; theo sau là nguyên mẫu.'],
 ['You ___ enter this room; access is forbidden.|Children ___ touch this equipment; it is prohibited.|Visitors ___ smoke here; the rules ban it.|Staff ___ share this code; it is strictly prohibited.','must not|do not have to|must to not|not must','Must not nghĩa là bị cấm. Do not have to nghĩa là không cần, không phải cấm.'],
 ['You ___ come tomorrow; attendance is optional.|We ___ pay for parking on Sundays; it is free.|They ___ wear a uniform on Fridays; it is optional.|You ___ print the ticket; the digital version is accepted.','do not have to|must not|do not have|have not to','Do not have to + V nghĩa là không bắt buộc.'],
 ['You ___ take a break if you feel tired; that is my advice.|We ___ back up our work regularly; I recommend it.|They ___ leave earlier to avoid the traffic; that is sensible advice.|You ___ ask your teacher when you do not understand.','should|should to|shoulds|are should','Should + V nguyên mẫu dùng để khuyên.']
]);
