 ['We had ___ lunch at noon; it was an ordinary meal.|They play ___ football after school.|I go to ___ work by bus every day.|She likes ___ music in general.','no article|a|an|the a','Các cụm thông dụng have lunch, play football, go to work và music nói chung không dùng mạo từ. “no article” nghĩa là để trống.']
