 ['___ you send the form today, it will arrive too late; posting it today is still not early enough.|___ we hurry now, we will miss the train; it has already left.|___ she apologises, the client will cancel; the decision is final.|___ they reduce the price, I will not buy it; I do not need it.','Even if|Unless|Because of|Despite of','Even if nghĩa là ngay cả nếu; kết quả không đổi dù điều kiện được đáp ứng.']
