 ['It is new for me, but I am getting used to ___ early.|She is gradually getting used to ___ at six.|We are getting used to ___ before sunrise.|They are getting used to ___ for morning training.','waking up|wake up|to wake up|woke up','Get used to + V-ing nói quá trình dần quen; không phải thói quen đã chấm dứt.'],
 ['I ___ like coffee, but now I drink it daily.|She ___ enjoy running, but now she loves it.|We ___ have a car, but now we own one.|They ___ watch TV, but now they watch every evening.','did not use to|did not used to|were not use to|not used to','Phủ định used to: did not use to + V.']
