 ['By six tonight, she will have been ___ for ten hours.|By the time we arrive, he will have been ___ all morning.|By midnight, Mai will have been ___ since noon.|By our next stop, the driver will have been ___ for four hours.','driving|drive|drove|driven','Sau will have been, dùng V-ing để tạo tương lai hoàn thành tiếp diễn.'],
 ['How long ___ you have been studying by the end of this year?|How long ___ they have been living here by June?|How long ___ she have been teaching by next summer?|How long ___ we have been waiting by noon?','will|have|do|are','Câu hỏi: How long + will + S + have been + V-ing?'],
 ['By next month, we ___ have been using the app for a full year; we started only three months ago.|By Friday, I ___ have been training for a month; I began yesterday.|By tomorrow, they ___ have been travelling for a week; they left today.|By June, she ___ have been teaching for ten years; she started last year.','will not|will not to|do not will|will has not','Phủ định: will not have been + V-ing; các mốc đã cho chưa đủ thời lượng được nêu.'],
 ['At noon tomorrow, I will have been waiting ___ two hours.|By Friday, she will have been practising ___ a month.|By December, we will have been working together ___ a year.|By six, they will have been driving ___ four hours.','for|since|at|on','For + khoảng thời lượng. Tương lai hoàn thành tiếp diễn nhấn mạnh thời gian hoạt động đến mốc tương lai.']
