addTest('mixed-conditionals',[
 ['If I ___ earlier last night, I would feel better now.|If she ___ better before the journey, she would be less tired now.|If we ___ enough before the race, we would have more energy now.|If he ___ longer last night, he would be more alert now.','had slept|have slept|sleep|would slept','Giả định nguyên nhân quá khứ → kết quả hiện tại: if + had + V3, would + V.'],
 ['If I had accepted that job last year, I ___ in London now.|If she had moved there in 2020, she ___ near us now.|If we had bought that flat, we ___ in the city now.|If he had stayed in Vietnam, he ___ in Hanoi now.','would live|would have lived yesterday|will lives|would lived','Kết quả giả định đang đúng ở hiện tại dùng would live, không phải would have lived cho một kết quả hoàn tất trong quá khứ.'],
 ['If I were more organised in general, I ___ the appointment yesterday.|If she were more careful by nature, she ___ the deadline last week.|If he were better at keeping schedules, he ___ the meeting yesterday.|If we were more reliable as a team, we ___ the interview last Monday.','would not have missed|would not miss yesterday|will not missed|would not had missed','Đặc điểm giả định hiện tại/tổng quát → kết quả khác trong quá khứ: if + quá khứ, would have + V3.'],
 ['If she ___ French, she would have understood yesterday’s speech; she still does not know French.|If he ___ Japanese, he would have followed that talk last week; he does not speak it.|If I ___ Spanish, I would have read that email yesterday; I do not know Spanish.|If we ___ German, we would have understood the notice then; none of us knows German.','knew|had know|will know|would known','Knew nói khả năng hiện tại/tổng quát giả định; would have understood/read nói kết quả quá khứ.'],
 ["I did not study coding in the past, and I am not a developer now. Choose the mixed conditional.|She did not accept that job last year, and she does not live in London now. Choose the mixed conditional.|We did not save enough last year, and we cannot buy a car now. Choose the mixed conditional.|He did not take the medicine yesterday, and he still feels ill now. Choose the mixed conditional.", ["If I had studied coding, I would be a developer now.|If I have studied coding, I would been a developer now.|If I would studied coding, I had be a developer now.|If I had study coding, I will be a developer now.", "If she had accepted the job, she would live in London now.|If she had accept the job, she would lived in London now.|If she would accepted the job, she had live in London now.|If she has accepted the job, she will lives in London now.", "If we had saved more, we could buy a car now.|If we had save more, we could bought a car now.|If we would saved more, we had buy a car now.|If we have saved more, we could buying a car now.", "If he had taken the medicine, he would feel better now.|If he had take the medicine, he would felt better now.|If he would taken the medicine, he had feel better now.|If he has take the medicine, he would feeling better now."], "If + had + V3 nói nguyên nhân giả định trong quá khứ; would/could + V nói kết quả giả định hiện tại, được đánh dấu bằng now."]
]);
