 ['The equipment ___ in Japan is expensive. (= that was made)|The car ___ in Germany belongs to Mai. (= that was made)|The furniture ___ locally is popular. (= that was made)|The phone ___ in Korea has arrived. (= that was made)','made|making|was make|to making','V3 rút gọn mệnh đề bị động; thiết bị/xe/nội thất được làm, không tự thực hiện hành động làm.']
