 ['What I need ___ a break.|What she wants ___ a new laptop.|What he enjoys ___ a long walk.|What the team requires ___ a clear plan.','is|are|does|be','Mệnh đề what được nhìn như một nội dung/điều cần; dùng is với phần bổ ngữ số ít ở đây.'],
 ["Choose the sentence that emphasises Anna as the person who called.|Choose the sentence that emphasises yesterday as the day we met.|Choose the sentence that emphasises Hanoi as the place we met.|Choose the sentence that emphasises the red bag as the object she chose.", ["It was Anna who called me.|It Anna was who called me.|What was Anna who called me.|It was who Anna called me.", "It was yesterday that we met.|It yesterday was that we met.|What was yesterday that we met.|It was that yesterday we met.", "It was in Hanoi that we met.|It in Hanoi was that we met.|What was in Hanoi that we met.|It was that in Hanoi we met.", "It was the red bag that she chose.|It the red bag was that she chose.|What was the red bag that she chose.|It was that the red bag she chose."], "It-cleft: It was + thành phần nhấn mạnh + who/that + phần còn lại. Dùng who cho người làm chủ ngữ; that dùng được cho các thành phần khác ở đây."]
